{"sentence_id": "hb-c08-u0096-s003", "text": "Studieprogrammet utarbetas av skolans studiehandledare, barnets klasslärare, specialklasslärare eller lärare i finska som andra språk.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c08-stod/narration/resume-20261103T030909109607+0000-16/hb-c08-u0096-s003.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 12.051156462585034, "peak": 0.355987548828125, "generation_seconds": 42.64512818190269, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c08-u0096-s004", "text": "De kan också utarbeta studieprogrammet tillsammans.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c08-stod/narration/resume-20261103T030909109607+0000-16/hb-c08-u0096-s004.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 4.73687074829932, "peak": 0.395751953125, "generation_seconds": 18.540215292945504, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c08-u0096-s005", "text": "De tar hänsyn till barnets kunskaper och tidigare studier.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c08-stod/narration/resume-20261103T030909109607+0000-16/hb-c08-u0096-s005.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 5.224489795918367, "peak": 0.30218505859375, "generation_seconds": 21.37070722109638, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c08-u0190-s001", "text": "Barn med funktionsnedsättning har rätt att gå i en närskola och få de stödåtgärder de behöver för sin skolgång.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c08-stod/narration/resume-20261103T030909109607+0000-16/hb-c08-u0190-s001.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 9.264761904761905, "peak": 0.273193359375, "generation_seconds": 28.865636497037485, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c08-u0190-s002", "text": "Stödåtgärderna kan vara hjälpmedel, en personlig assistent eller en tolk.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c08-stod/narration/resume-20261103T030909109607+0000-16/hb-c08-u0190-s002.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 6.617687074829932, "peak": 0.3704833984375, "generation_seconds": 18.377813726197928, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c08-u0190-s003", "text": "Undervisningen kan också individualiseras, vilket betyder att man sätter upp egna, individuella mål för det handikappade barnets lärande som kan avvika från den allmänna läroplanen.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c08-stod/narration/resume-20261103T030909109607+0000-16/hb-c08-u0190-s003.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 15.046530612244897, "peak": 0.325897216796875, "generation_seconds": 43.64878938510083, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c08-u0190-s004", "text": "Man kan också besluta att ett barn med funktionsnedsättning ska omfattas av förlängd läroplikt.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c08-stod/narration/resume-20261103T030909109607+0000-16/hb-c08-u0190-s004.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 8.498503401360544, "peak": 0.453125, "generation_seconds": 25.254078631056473, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c08-u0190-s005", "text": "Förlängd läroplikt betyder att barnet börjar skolan redan som 6-åring.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c08-stod/narration/resume-20261103T030909109607+0000-16/hb-c08-u0190-s005.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 6.6873469387755105, "peak": 0.304443359375, "generation_seconds": 20.00272928387858, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
